        {
          "title": "1. Take Pics & Share",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Quick Pic lets you take and share pictures right away.</li>\n<li>Select the <strong>Camera icon</strong> to start.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/9109cc5bb272b903.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Camera opens",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Take an image as you wish.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/d6d74241e5e1b0f7.webp",
              "width": 1080,
              "height": 2340
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Fill in Details",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>By tapping the <strong>Pen icon</strong>, you may fill details on the image.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/9149da436f4c2709.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Filling...",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Describe details as you wish.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/94d9e291cef5c019.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Rename the image",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>By tapping the <strong>Edit Name icon</strong>, you may rename the image.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/6c2f87cd6f97b770.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Renaming...",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>A descriptive name is recommended.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/620823070e61033d.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Sharing via Send",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>As with Markers, the Quick Pics are only present in your device. Send to a Feed or a Role (or a user).</li>\n<li>Deploy App x TAK's standard model in sharing can be found at Usage by Role.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/a3a3a3210e81ea7e.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Attach a File to a Marker",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Open a marker and select the <strong>Attachments</strong> (paperclip) icon to add an image, video or file.</li>\n<li>Tick <strong>Auto Send</strong> to keep the marker updating to the network roughly every 60 seconds.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/029fe4cc0794346f.webp",
              "width": 349,
              "height": 198
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Review in the Gallery",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Open the <strong>Gallery</strong> tool to browse every media attachment with its file name and linked map item.</li>\n<li>Tap an image, then tap the line at the top to add a caption.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
